window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>\"Bitten by Night\" </p> <p>Kiara wants Royce, but felines and wolves don't mix. That's until she goes into heat and finds herself being chased by the big bad wolf himself. Will Royce get her to submit to his desires for a lifetime, or will she take their night of passion and walk away from the promise of a mating by moonlight? </p> <p>\"Seduced by Days\" </p> <p>Stephanie wants Bryan and Brent Day. She's dying to get the two tattooed and pierced hot men naked and in her bed. But how will she cope when she realizes they want the same for her? And when the night is over, will she be willing to see more of them? </p> <p>\"Mated by Night\" </p> <p>Ana Cruz is a bold, curvy tigress coming up on her heat. She's also fighting a battle of wills with an uncooperative copier at her job - but that's the least of her problems. Her main issue is Callum Night, her boss. Oh, she knows cats and wolves don't mix, but try telling that to her hormones. When she's caught red-handed in Callum's office by the big man himself, events take a turn for the growly kind. </p> <p>\"Taken by Night\" </p> <p>Valentina Cruz is a sexy, curvy woman with a new job, thanks to her sister and cousin. But with the awesome job comes her heat and desperate need to mate. Brett Night is going to his hotel when the delicious scent of a tigress stops his wolf on his tracks. With bountiful curves, gorgeous mocha skin, and lips made for kissing, she's exactly what he'd hoped for in a mate. Who cared that they were different species? </p> <p><b>Note: These stories contain smokin' hot sex. If you have problems with low down dirty hanky-panky, you might want to skip this one. However, if you like a curvy woman who loves her body, a man who'll do amazing things with his tongue, and some cheeky humor, this is the story for you. Enjoy.</b> </p>"; 
